causeTitle.format:
LEGAL NOTICE
(Under {governing_act} — Notice to Quit and Deliver Vacant Possession)

To,
{respondent}
{respondentAddress}

From,
{applicant}
Through: {advocateName}, Advocate
{advocateAddress}

prayerTemplate:
You are hereby called upon to:
(a) Vacate and deliver peaceful and vacant possession of the said premises being {premises_description} to my client on or before {expiry_date}, being a period of {notice_days} days from the date of receipt of this notice / from the end of the current month of tenancy as required by {governing_act};
(b) Pay all arrears of rent amounting to Rs. {arrears_amount}/- for the period {arrears_period}, along with interest;
(c) Pay mesne profits at the rate of Rs. {mesne_rate}/- per month for the period of continued unauthorised occupation, if any, after {expiry_date};
(d) Hand over the keys and remove all personal belongings on or before the said date.

PLEASE TAKE NOTICE that on your failure to comply with the above, my client shall be constrained to file a suit for eviction, recovery of arrears, mesne profits, and damages before the competent {court_or_rent_authority} under the provisions of {governing_act}, entirely at your risk, cost, and consequences.

Your tenancy stands terminated with effect from {termination_date}.
